{
    "comment": "코어 새 버전 확인 결과 창 — 있으면 버전과 이력을, 없으면 최신이라는 안내를 보여 준다.\n  올리는 것은 여기서 하지 않고 안내 창(`_modal_core_update_guide`)으로 넘긴다.",
    "meta": {
        "is_partial": true,
        "description": "코어 업데이트 확인 결과 모달",
        "editor_label": "$t:admin.modal_label.admin_settings.core_update_result_modal"
    },
    "id": "core_update_result_modal",
    "type": "composite",
    "name": "Modal",
    "props": {
        "title": "$t:admin.settings.info.update_result_title",
        "size": "md"
    },
    "children": [
        {
            "type": "basic",
            "name": "Div",
            "props": {
                "className": "row-stack"
            },
            "children": [
                {
                    "type": "basic",
                    "name": "Div",
                    "props": {
                        "className": "flex-between border-b border-gray-100 dark:border-gray-700"
                    },
                    "children": [
                        {
                            "type": "basic",
                            "name": "Span",
                            "props": {
                                "className": "text-label"
                            },
                            "text": "$t:admin.settings.info.current_version"
                        },
                        {
                            "type": "basic",
                            "name": "Span",
                            "props": {
                                "className": "text-heading"
                            },
                            "text": "{{$parent._local.coreUpdateInfo?.current_version ?? '-'}}"
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "type": "basic",
                    "name": "Div",
                    "props": {
                        "className": "flex-between border-b border-gray-100 dark:border-gray-700"
                    },
                    "children": [
                        {
                            "type": "basic",
                            "name": "Span",
                            "props": {
                                "className": "text-label"
                            },
                            "text": "$t:admin.settings.info.latest_version"
                        },
                        {
                            "type": "basic",
                            "name": "Span",
                            "props": {
                                "className": "text-heading"
                            },
                            "text": "{{$parent._local.coreUpdateInfo?.latest_version ?? '-'}}"
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "comment": "직전 업데이트 시도가 개발자 custom 자리 사전 검사로 시작 전에 멈췄을 때만 보인다(같은 새 버전 한정) —\n     개발자 패키지(custom/composer.lock)가 새 코어와 맞지 않거나 배포본이 custom 예약 자리에 파일을 실었다.",
                    "id": "custom_preflight_section",
                    "type": "basic",
                    "name": "Div",
                    "if": "{{!!$parent._local.coreUpdateInfo?.custom_preflight}}",
                    "props": {
                        "className": "space-y-3",
                        "role": "alert"
                    },
                    "children": [
                        {
                            "type": "basic",
                            "name": "Div",
                            "props": {
                                "className": "alert-warning space-y-1"
                            },
                            "children": [
                                {
                                    "type": "basic",
                                    "name": "P",
                                    "props": {
                                        "className": "text-sm font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-white"
                                    },
                                    "text": "$t:admin.settings.info.custom_preflight_title"
                                },
                                {
                                    "type": "basic",
                                    "name": "P",
                                    "if": "{{($parent._local.coreUpdateInfo?.custom_preflight?.conflicts ?? []).length > 0}}",
                                    "props": {
                                        "className": "text-sm text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300"
                                    },
                                    "text": "$t:admin.settings.info.custom_preflight_desc|count={{($parent._local.coreUpdateInfo?.custom_preflight?.conflicts ?? []).length}}|version={{$parent._local.coreUpdateInfo?.custom_preflight?.to_version ?? ''}}"
                                }
                            ]
                        },
                        {
                            "type": "basic",
                            "name": "Div",
                            "if": "{{($parent._local.coreUpdateInfo?.custom_preflight?.conflicts ?? []).length > 0}}",
                            "props": {
                                "className": "overflow-x-auto border border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-700 rounded-lg"
                            },
                            "children": [
                                {
                                    "type": "basic",
                                    "name": "Table",
                                    "props": {
                                        "className": "min-w-full text-sm"
                                    },
                                    "children": [
                                        {
                                            "type": "basic",
                                            "name": "Thead",
                                            "props": {
                                                "className": "bg-gray-50 dark:bg-gray-700/50"
                                            },
                                            "children": [
                                                {
                                                    "type": "basic",
                                                    "name": "Tr",
                                                    "children": [
                                                        {
                                                            "type": "basic",
                                                            "name": "Th",
                                                            "props": {
                                                                "className": "px-3 py-2 text-left font-medium text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300"
                                                            },
                                                            "text": "$t:admin.settings.info.custom_conflict_package"
                                                        },
                                                        {
                                                            "type": "basic",
                                                            "name": "Th",
                                                            "props": {
                                                                "className": "px-3 py-2 text-left font-medium text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300"
                                                            },
                                                            "text": "$t:admin.settings.info.custom_conflict_reason"
                                                        },
                                                        {
                                                            "type": "basic",
                                                            "name": "Th",
                                                            "props": {
                                                                "className": "px-3 py-2 text-left font-medium text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300"
                                                            },
                                                            "text": "$t:admin.settings.info.custom_conflict_core"
                                                        }
                                                    ]
                                                }
                                            ]
                                        },
                                        {
                                            "type": "basic",
                                            "name": "Tbody",
                                            "children": [
                                                {
                                                    "type": "basic",
                                                    "name": "Tr",
                                                    "iteration": {
                                                        "source": "{{$parent._local.coreUpdateInfo?.custom_preflight?.conflicts ?? []}}",
                                                        "item_var": "conflict"
                                                    },
                                                    "props": {
                                                        "className": "border-t border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-700 align-top"
                                                    },
                                                    "children": [
                                                        {
                                                            "type": "basic",
                                                            "name": "Td",
                                                            "props": {
                                                                "className": "px-3 py-2"
                                                            },
                                                            "children": [
                                                                {
                                                                    "type": "basic",
                                                                    "name": "Span",
                                                                    "props": {
                                                                        "className": "block font-mono text-gray-900 dark:text-white"
                                                                    },
                                                                    "text": "{{conflict.package}}"
                                                                },
                                                                {
                                                                    "type": "basic",
                                                                    "name": "Span",
                                                                    "props": {
                                                                        "className": "block text-xs text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400"
                                                                    },
                                                                    "text": "$t:admin.settings.info.custom_conflict_installed|version={{conflict.installed}}"
                                                                }
                                                            ]
                                                        },
                                                        {
                                                            "type": "basic",
                                                            "name": "Td",
                                                            "props": {
                                                                "className": "px-3 py-2 text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300"
                                                            },
                                                            "children": [
                                                                {
                                                                    "type": "basic",
                                                                    "name": "Span",
                                                                    "if": "{{conflict.type === 'duplicate'}}",
                                                                    "text": "$t:admin.settings.info.custom_conflict_duplicate"
                                                                },
                                                                {
                                                                    "type": "basic",
                                                                    "name": "Span",
                                                                    "if": "{{conflict.type !== 'duplicate'}}",
                                                                    "text": "$t:admin.settings.info.custom_conflict_constraint|requires={{conflict.requires}}|constraint={{conflict.constraint}}"
                                                                }
                                                            ]
                                                        },
                                                        {
                                                            "type": "basic",
                                                            "name": "Td",
                                                            "props": {
                                                                "className": "px-3 py-2 font-mono text-xs text-amber-700 dark:text-amber-400"
                                                            },
                                                            "text": "{{conflict.core_package}} {{conflict.core_version}}"
                                                        }
                                                    ]
                                                }
                                            ]
                                        }
                                    ]
                                }
                            ]
                        },
                        {
                            "type": "basic",
                            "name": "Div",
                            "if": "{{($parent._local.coreUpdateInfo?.custom_preflight?.reserved_files ?? []).length > 0}}",
                            "props": {
                                "className": "space-y-1"
                            },
                            "children": [
                                {
                                    "type": "basic",
                                    "name": "P",
                                    "props": {
                                        "className": "text-sm text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300"
                                    },
                                    "text": "$t:admin.settings.info.custom_reserved_files"
                                },
                                {
                                    "type": "basic",
                                    "name": "Ul",
                                    "props": {
                                        "className": "text-xs font-mono text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 list-disc pl-5"
                                    },
                                    "children": [
                                        {
                                            "type": "basic",
                                            "name": "Li",
                                            "iteration": {
                                                "source": "{{$parent._local.coreUpdateInfo?.custom_preflight?.reserved_files ?? []}}",
                                                "item_var": "reservedFile"
                                            },
                                            "text": "{{reservedFile}}"
                                        }
                                    ]
                                }
                            ]
                        },
                        {
                            "type": "basic",
                            "name": "Div",
                            "props": {
                                "className": "space-y-1 text-sm text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300"
                            },
                            "children": [
                                {
                                    "type": "basic",
                                    "name": "P",
                                    "props": {
                                        "className": "font-semibold"
                                    },
                                    "text": "$t:admin.settings.info.custom_fix_title"
                                },
                                {
                                    "type": "basic",
                                    "name": "Ol",
                                    "props": {
                                        "className": "list-decimal pl-5 space-y-1"
                                    },
                                    "children": [
                                        {
                                            "type": "basic",
                                            "name": "Li",
                                            "text": "$t:admin.settings.info.custom_fix_step1"
                                        },
                                        {
                                            "type": "basic",
                                            "name": "Li",
                                            "text": "$t:admin.settings.info.custom_fix_step2"
                                        },
                                        {
                                            "type": "basic",
                                            "name": "Li",
                                            "text": "$t:admin.settings.info.custom_fix_step3"
                                        }
                                    ]
                                }
                            ]
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "id": "update_available_section",
                    "type": "basic",
                    "name": "Div",
                    "if": "{{$parent._local.coreUpdateInfo?.update_available}}",
                    "props": {
                        "className": "space-y-3"
                    },
                    "children": [
                        {
                            "type": "basic",
                            "name": "Div",
                            "props": {
                                "className": "alert-success"
                            },
                            "children": [
                                {
                                    "type": "basic",
                                    "name": "P",
                                    "props": {
                                        "className": "text-success-soft"
                                    },
                                    "text": "$t:admin.settings.info.update_available_message"
                                }
                            ]
                        },
                        {
                            "type": "basic",
                            "name": "Div",
                            "props": {
                                "className": "flex gap-2 justify-end"
                            },
                            "children": [
                                {
                                    "type": "basic",
                                    "name": "Button",
                                    "actions": [
                                        {
                                            "comment": "변경 이력 보기 — 현재↔최신 두 버전 사이의 이력을 받아 이력 창을 연다. 실패해도 빈 이력으로\n     창을 연다(이력이 없다고 안내 자체를 막지 않는다). 받은 값은 **부모 화면의 상태**로 담기고\n     이력 창이 그것을 `$parent` 로 읽는다.",
                                            "type": "click",
                                            "handler": "apiCall",
                                            "target": "/api/admin/core-update/changelog",
                                            "auth_required": true,
                                            "params": {
                                                "method": "GET",
                                                "query": {
                                                    "from_version": "{{$parent._local.coreUpdateInfo?.current_version ?? ''}}",
                                                    "to_version": "{{$parent._local.coreUpdateInfo?.latest_version ?? ''}}"
                                                }
                                            },
                                            "onSuccess": [
                                                {
                                                    "handler": "setState",
                                                    "params": {
                                                        "target": "local",
                                                        "coreChangelog": "{{result.data.changelog ?? []}}"
                                                    }
                                                },
                                                {
                                                    "handler": "openModal",
                                                    "target": "core_changelog_modal"
                                                }
                                            ],
                                            "onError": [
                                                {
                                                    "handler": "setState",
                                                    "params": {
                                                        "target": "local",
                                                        "coreChangelog": []
                                                    }
                                                },
                                                {
                                                    "handler": "openModal",
                                                    "target": "core_changelog_modal"
                                                }
                                            ]
                                        }
                                    ],
                                    "props": {
                                        "type": "button",
                                        "className": "px-3 py-1.5 text-sm font-medium text-white bg-gray-900 dark:bg-white dark:text-gray-900 rounded-md hover:bg-gray-800 dark:hover:bg-gray-100 transition-colors"
                                    },
                                    "text": "$t:admin.settings.info.view_changelog"
                                },
                                {
                                    "type": "basic",
                                    "name": "Button",
                                    "actions": [
                                        {
                                            "type": "click",
                                            "handler": "openModal",
                                            "target": "core_update_guide_modal"
                                        }
                                    ],
                                    "props": {
                                        "type": "button",
                                        "className": "px-3 py-1.5 text-sm font-medium text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 bg-white dark:bg-gray-700 border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-600 rounded-md hover:bg-gray-50 dark:hover:bg-gray-600 transition-colors"
                                    },
                                    "text": "$t:admin.settings.info.how_to_update"
                                }
                            ]
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "id": "no_update_section",
                    "type": "basic",
                    "name": "Div",
                    "if": "{{!$parent._local.coreUpdateInfo?.update_available}}",
                    "props": {
                        "className": ""
                    },
                    "children": [
                        {
                            "type": "basic",
                            "name": "Div",
                            "props": {
                                "className": "alert-info"
                            },
                            "children": [
                                {
                                    "type": "basic",
                                    "name": "P",
                                    "props": {
                                        "className": "text-info-soft"
                                    },
                                    "text": "$t:admin.settings.info.no_update_message"
                                }
                            ]
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        }
    ]
}
